    {
      "id": "former-shu-wang-jian-xu-yisheng-xu-aunt-shufei",
      "title": "进位淑妃",
      "summary": "本传记徐氏在高祖时进位淑妃，宫中称花蕋夫人、小徐妃。",
      "year": null,
      "precision": "undated",
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "sourceDate": "高祖时，未独载年月",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v038",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v038-p4",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "c7dac9ebb8ec25b33ae8d72791e0337046d6331b3e44b2a5641c19455abf6ac7",
          "excerpt": "翊聖皇太妃徐氏，耕次女也。高祖時進位淑妃，宫中稱爲花蕋夫人，亦曰小徐妃。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
